  "statement": "I appreciate the ongoing dialogue regarding the merging of overlapping requirements. I support the proposed consolidations of SAF-01 with RES-03 and SAF-03 with RES-06, as this can enhance clarity while maintaining critical safety aspects. However, I strongly believe that TRU-01, TRU-02, TRU-03, TRU-04, TRU-05, TRU-06, and TRU-07 must remain intact, as they are vital for ensuring data protection, access control, and auditing capabilities. I also agree with integrating sustainability criteria into performance requirements to create a balanced approach that considers both efficiency and security.",
